    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "If you ever look behind and don't like what you find",
      "start": 63.58,
      "end": 71.5
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "there's something you should know",
      "start": 71.5,
      "end": 74.7
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "You've got a place to go",
      "start": 75.3,
      "end": 83.5
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "I used to say I and me",
      "start": 83.5,
      "end": 90.38
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Now it's us now it's we",
      "start": 91.6,
      "end": 96.76
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Now it's us now it's we",
      "start": 125.34,
      "end": 126.74
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "They don't see you as I do",
      "start": 126.74,
      "end": 131.3
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "I wish they would try to",
      "start": 132.12,
      "end": 134.88
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "I'm sure they'd think again if they had a friend like Ben",
      "start": 135.38,
      "end": 142.56
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "Like Ben like Ben like Ben",
      "start": 147.1,
      "end": 158.22
    }
